     "title": "5.7. Yechib ko‘rsatilgan masalalar",
     "html": "<div class=\"callout\"><p><b>1-masala.</b> Aksiya bir yildan keyin 12 ming so‘m dividend beradi va 110 ming so‘mga sotilishi kutilmoqda. Foiz stavkasi 20%. Arbitraj yo‘qligi shartiga ko‘ra aksiyaning bugungi narxi qancha?</p></div><div class=\"callout callout-calc\"><p><b>Yechish.</b></p><p><span class=\"fx\">p<sub>0</sub> = (12+110)/1,2 = 101,67</span> ming so‘m.</p><p><b>2-masala.</b> O‘rmon qiymati <span class=\"fx\">F(t) = 100√t</span> (mln so‘m), foiz stavkasi 5%. Optimal kesish vaqtini toping.</p></div><div class=\"callout callout-calc\"><p><b>Yechish.</b></p><p><span class=\"fx\">F′/F = (50/√t)/(100√t) = (1)/(2t) = 0,05</span>, bundan <span class=\"fx\">T = 10</span> yil (uzluksiz diskontlash farazi ostida).</p><p><b>3-masala.</b> Iste’molchi naflilik funksiyasi <span class=\"fx\">u = lnw</span>, boyligi 100. U 50% ehtimol bilan 36 yutadigan va 50% ehtimol bilan 36 yutqazadigan o‘yinda qatnashishi taklif qilindi. Risk mukofotini aniq va Errou–Pratt formulasi bo‘yicha taxminiy hisoblang.</p></div><div class=\"callout callout-calc\"><p><b>Yechish.</b></p><p><span class=\"fx\">EU = 0,5ln136+0,5ln64 = 0,5(4,9127+4,1589) = 4,5358</span>; <span class=\"fx\">CE = e<sup>4,5358</sup> = 93,30</span>; <span class=\"fx\">RP = 100−93,30 = 6,70</span>. Taxminiy: <span class=\"fx\">r<sub>A</sub> = 1/100</span>, <span class=\"fx\">σ<sup>2</sup> = 1 296</span>; <span class=\"fx\">RP ≈ 0,5·0,01·1 296 = 6,48</span>. Taxminiy formula yaxshi yaqinlashish beradi.</p><p><b>4-masala.</b> Investor <span class=\"fx\">U = μ−2σ<sup>2</sup></span> naflilik funksiyasiga ega. <span class=\"fx\">r<sub>f</sub> = 0,08</span>, <span class=\"fx\">r<sub>m</sub> = 0,16</span>, <span class=\"fx\">σ<sub>m</sub> = 0,2</span>. Riskli aktivga qo‘yiladigan optimal ulush <span class=\"fx\">x</span> ni toping.</p></div><div class=\"callout callout-calc\"><p><b>Yechish.</b></p><p><span class=\"fx\">μ = 0,08+0,08x</span>, <span class=\"fx\">σ<sup>2</sup> = 0,04x<sup>2</sup></span>. <span class=\"fx\">U = 0,08+0,08x−0,08x<sup>2</sup></span>. <span class=\"fx\">dU/dx = 0,08−0,16x = 0</span>, <span class=\"fx\">x<sup>*</sup> = 0,5</span>. Investor mablag‘ining yarmini riskli aktivga qo‘yadi; portfel daromadliligi 12%, riski 10%.</p></div>"
